// vim: ft=kdl
// niri tren rog. Tach theo khuon sway.d/hyprland.d (22/08/2026): file nay chi
// con la khung include; noi dung nam o conf.d/{system,shortcuts,tab}.kdl.
//
// KHAC HAI SESSION KIA O BA DIEM, va ca ba deu de nham:
//
// 1. PHIM QUAN LY CUA SO LA MAC DINH CUA UPSTREAM, khong dich tu sway.d/hypr.d
//    (quyet dinh 14/08/2026). niri la scrollable-tiling: mot dai cot truot
//    ngang, khong co cay container. `layout stacking`, `layout tabbed`,
//    `focus parent` cua sway khong co gi tuong ung, con `consume/expel window`,
//    `switch-preset-column-width`, `center-column` thi sway/hyprland khong co.
//    Dich qua lai chi tao ra mot ban lai nua vong. Tra cuu phim NGAY TRONG
//    PHIEN bang Mod+Shift+/. Nghia la: co bap tay sway/hyprland KHONG dung lai
//    duoc o day. Lop tien ich (bo goc, gio/pin, clipboard, nguon may, am luong/
//    do sang co notify) thi DA port vao conf.d/, 22/08/2026.
//
// 2. Bo phim launcher sinh tu configs/shortcuts/launch-app.toml (beckon, to
//    hop `Cap`) duoc NOI VAO bang dung mot dong `include` duoi day, lap y khuon
//    sway/hyprland (`~/.config/sway-nix/`, `~/.config/hypr-nix/`). File do do
//    home-manager SINH LUC EVAL (~/.config/niri-nix/launch-app.kdl) — sua TOML
//    thi phai switch; con sau switch niri tu live-reload, khong can buoc gi
//    nua (sway/hyprland van phai Tab+r).
//
// 3. niri TU LIVE-RELOAD toan bo cay include. Sua xong luu la an ngay: khong
//    switch, khong `Tab+r`. Doi lai, config hong thi no giu ban cu va bao loi
//    — chay `niri validate` de doc loi cho ro.
//
// THU TU include CO Y NGHIA: bind trung nhau GIUA CAC FILE thi dinh nghia sau
// thang (merge), nhung TRONG CUNG MOT FILE la LOI CUNG — da do 22/08/2026 khi
// them Tab+r de len switch-preset-window-height. launch-app o truoc nen lop
// conf.d duoc phep de len no neu co trung.
//
// ~/.config/niri la symlink CA THU MUC vao repo (xem ../default.nix), vi vay
// duong dan include tuyet doi ben duoi van chay dung vao cay nay.

// Launcher bindings, sinh tu configs/shortcuts/launch-app.toml.
include "~/.config/niri-nix/launch-app.kdl"

include "~/.config/niri/conf.d/system.kdl"
include "~/.config/niri/conf.d/shortcuts.kdl"
include "~/.config/niri/conf.d/tab.kdl"
